# HR Attrition Analytics Dashboard

This project is a dynamic HR analytics dashboard that updates insights instantly when a CSV dataset is uploaded.

## Features
- CSV upload
- Executive Overview KPIs
- Attrition trend analysis
- Division-wise & location-wise attrition
- Dataset preview table

## Tech Stack
- FastAPI (Python)
- React.js
- Recharts

## How It Works
1. Upload HR data in CSV format
2. Dashboard recalculates KPIs and charts
3. Insights update automatically

